        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A virus has corrupted a massive production robot, causing it to churn out hostile machines without end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must infiltrate the danger zone directly, destroy the endlessly pouring robots, and bring down the production robot—the source of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacubot is a fast-paced, top-down shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player uses a variety of weapons to face swarming enemy robots and must survive in increasingly challenging battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fight stronger and stronger enemies, enhance your weapons and abilities, and challenge three mechanical bosses with powerful patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominating the battlefield is not just about reflexes but also about speed, weapons, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Various Weapons</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067540/extras/fd03a48f0a7b3046acad29bd33632a99.avif?t=1770445745\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to collect coins and purchase new equipment at the weapon shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The minigun unleashes a storm of bullets, the charge weapon delivers a devastating single shot, and the laser pierces through multiple enemies—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each weapon provides unique performance and strategic options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Various Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067540/extras/81dfa4d4e54c3957ffe11e72fa0c570d.avif?t=1770445745\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As battles progress, more difficult and powerful robots appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From mobs that fire bullets in barrages, to laser shooters, armored types, splitting types, and enemies that explode upon death—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new threats await in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Intense Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067540/extras/1d95be226642918d407d60736154fe27.avif?t=1770445745\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the battles progress, three types of giant mechanical bosses appear one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss tests the player with unique attack patterns and deadly techniques,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaving no room for even a moment of carelessness.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A virus has corrupted a massive production robot, causing it to churn out hostile machines without end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player must infiltrate the danger zone directly, destroy the endlessly pouring robots, and bring down the production robot—the source of chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vacubot is a fast-paced, top-down shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player uses a variety of weapons to face swarming enemy robots and must survive in increasingly challenging battlefields.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fight stronger and stronger enemies, enhance your weapons and abilities, and challenge three mechanical bosses with powerful patterns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dominating the battlefield is not just about reflexes but also about speed, weapons, and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Various Weapons</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067540/extras/fd03a48f0a7b3046acad29bd33632a99.avif?t=1770445745\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies to collect coins and purchase new equipment at the weapon shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The minigun unleashes a storm of bullets, the charge weapon delivers a devastating single shot, and the laser pierces through multiple enemies—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >each weapon provides unique performance and strategic options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Various Enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067540/extras/81dfa4d4e54c3957ffe11e72fa0c570d.avif?t=1770445745\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As battles progress, more difficult and powerful robots appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From mobs that fire bullets in barrages, to laser shooters, armored types, splitting types, and enemies that explode upon death—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new threats await in every battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >- Intense Boss Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4067540/extras/1d95be226642918d407d60736154fe27.avif?t=1770445745\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the battles progress, three types of giant mechanical bosses appear one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss tests the player with unique attack patterns and deadly techniques,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leaving no room for even a moment of carelessness.</p>",
